.libsyn.com/ep-40-honestly-loving-olivia-newton-john"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Longest Climb to Number One (2023)","body":"Brenda Lee's \"Rockin' Around the Christmas Tree\" achieved the longest climb to number one in chart history in 2023, taking 65 years from its initial recording and release in 1958. \"The longest climb to number one in chart history at 65 years.\"","year":2023,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"Second-Chance Hits Edition Part 2","url":null},{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"Second-Chance Hits Edition Part 2","url":"https://shows.acast.com/hit-parade/episodes/695d4ef18e6dd12efb02c42e"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Longest Gap Between Number One Hits (2023)","body":"In 2023, Brenda Lee set the record for the longest gap between number one hits at 63 years, with \"Rockin' Around the Christmas Tree\" reaching the top spot after her previous number one, \"I Want to Be Wanted,\" in 1960. \"And the longest gap between number one hits 63 years between Christmas tree and Lee's previous number one in 1960 I Want To Be Wanted.\"","year":2023,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"Second-Chance Hits Edition Part 2","url":null},{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"Second-Chance Hits Edition Part 2","url":"https://shows.acast.com/hit-parade/episodes/695d4ef18e6dd12efb02c42e"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Oldest Chart Topper Ever (2023)","body":"In 2023, at 78 years old, Brenda Lee became the oldest chart topper ever when \"Rockin' Around the Christmas Tree\" reached number one, surpassing Louis Armstrong's record of 62 with \"Hello Dolly.\" \"Lee, the oldest chart top ever at 78 years old, surpassing Louis Armstrong's 62 when he led with Hello Dolly.\"","year":2023,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Hit Parade Music History and Music Trivia","episode":"Second-Chance Hits Edition Part 2","url":null},{"so